  <wpt lat="30.845400" lon="78.483200"><ele>2147</ele><name>Sangam Chatti Roadhead Trailhead</name><desc>Roadhead near Uttarkashi at the confluence of the Assi Ganga torrent.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.865000" lon="78.490000"><ele>2400</ele><name>Bebra Forest Clearing &amp; Stream</name><desc>Picturesque streamside camping clearing and rest point.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.885000" lon="78.502000"><ele>2850</ele><name>Manjhi High Shepherd Village</name><desc>Shepherd hamlet set amidst mixed oak, pine, and rhododendron forests.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.903000" lon="78.512000"><ele>3050</ele><name>Dodital Emerald Glacial Tarn</name><desc>Sacred crystal-clear freshwater tarn revered as the birthplace of Lord Ganesha.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.913700" lon="78.511700"><ele>3790</ele><name>Darwa Pass Summit Col</name><desc>Panoramic ridge pass framing jaw-dropping vistas of Bandarpoonch (6,316m) and Swargarohini.</desc></wpt>
